<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Giriş Yap — CroShy Anı</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/img/logo-64.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/img/logo-192.png" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <div class="bg-blobs">
    <div class="blob b1"></div>
    <div class="blob b2"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="admin-login-wrap">
    <div class="login-card">
      <h1>Giriş Yap</h1>
      <p>Anı paylaşabilmek için giriş yapman gerekiyor.</p>
      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <% if (error) { %>
          <div class="login-error"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>
        <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Kullanıcı adı" autocomplete="username" autofocus required />
        <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Şifre" autocomplete="current-password" required />
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary" style="width:100%; justify-content:center;">Giriş Yap</button>
      </form>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;">Hesabın yok mu? <a href="/register" style="color: var(--accent-3);">Kayıt ol</a></p>
      <p style="margin-top:8px;"><a href="/" style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size:0.85rem;">← Ana sayfaya dön</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
